/(4000-5377). THEN PATTERN WORDS (5400-
/5577). THEN LINE ADRESS AND LINE-CONTRL
/WORDS FOR DISPLAY (5600 UP)
/
	SEGMNT 2
	*1400
/PATTERN WORDS FOR CHAR DISPLAY FOLLOWS
PATRN,	4477		/A
	7744
	5177		/B
	2651
	4136		/C
