/
/LINE ADDRESS POINTERS (1/2 WORD).UP TO
/16 OF THEM + 1 EXTRA FOR WRAP-UP
/
LINADS,	0
	*.+20
/LINE CONTROL WORDS: 16 MAX
LINCON,	0
